{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pulls/368","id":5120581649,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUfdcjM8AAAABMTXgEQ","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/368","diff_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/368.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pull/368.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/368","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pulls/368/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pulls/368/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/issues/368/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/statuses/b2432c9ea79a6927675883ddde04f629b159be2d","number":368,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"ci: Skip root evidence in documents checkout","user":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"【dot】\n\nDocuments job 的 checkout 會取回它不使用的根 `evidence/` 歷史 payload。這個變更只讓 `matrix.suite == 'documents'` 使用 `blob:none`＋non-cone sparse checkout，排除根 `/evidence/`；其餘 browser、native、#366 checkout 全部維持原樣。\n\n| 項目 | 固定來源與結果 |\n|---|---|\n| Utility head | `b2432c9ea79a6927675883ddde04f629b159be2d`；sole parent main `e02057b4c725d6f03ae52c3bc30776bf9442b0cf` |\n| 唯一變更 | `.github/workflows/integration-tests.yml`；兩個互斥的 `matrix.suite` checkout，pin 不變，兩者仍 `persist-credentials: false` |\n| 保留輸入 | `/*`、`!/evidence/`；仍保留 `tests/evidence`、`tests/release-evidence`、`geometry-core/domain-decoupling/evidence` 及所有其他 nested evidence |\n| 原 guard | documents whole-job 仍 **10 分鐘**；native 三片35分鐘、其他browser時限、原 build/fonts/runtime/browser/upload 命令、matrix、permissions、credentials、assertions、golden、expected／skip／freshness policy 均未改 |\n| 本地驗證 | YAML／原命令／完整diff靜態核對通過；actual file／936-byte canonical patch 精確等預審candidate；所有其他Git entries（含SSOT三件、架構policy、mutation helper/workflow及237-suite expected）相同 |\n| 原 freshness 命令 | 在此head實跑 `python3 -B tests/mutate.py --check` exit0，6.880秒；123＝114 killed／1 crashed／5 equivalent／3 retired，stale／blocked／survived／invalid均0。帳本原bytes未改、私有logical cache前後不存在；這是logical source/tool/closure核驗，未重跑產品或為timestamp重產123 |\n| 新CI gate | Draft；此utility尚未取得新的真UI47或完整required CI通過。必須用原命令完成documents47與完整required CI，保留原10分鐘時限後才驗收 |\n\n[原F首次documents job](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/actions/runs/41437638054/job/125251333430) 在 fetch 約612秒後顯示 `The operation was canceled`；整job約617秒，build／browser尚未執行。原workflow對documents配置的是10分鐘whole-job預算，並未證實checkout另有10分鐘命令timer，精確取消發起者仍未知。Pinned checkout source 的10000ms delay是process退出後等stdio關閉的10秒。\n\nRoot `/evidence/` 的Git trees API metadata（未截斷）列出17,742 blobs、2,659,549,972 logical bytes；這不是wire transfer或效能測量。靜態依賴審查保全原47個嚴格check、55-file local require保守閉包、740 runtime sources、351 static routes／8 catalog routes，以及三個native各195 inputs；沒有找到這個固定documents47流程需要的root evidence leaf。PDF、Markdown、notes與case assets均為原程式在TEMP／瀏覽器生成；沒有本地執行Chrome／build／新UI驗收。\n\n[#345既有attempt2 documents成功](https://github.com/ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom/actions/runs/41437638054/job/125268717592) 屬原F `f8f0b433ee01429c2c4d7d5f20a85d3d9a9f1b12`，與本utility分開；原403請求沒有建立該rerun，這裡不移標或歸功。首次cancelled與其他原件均保留。\n\n這不是全域sparse規則：PR338 recovery實際讀root evidence，#366 bridge scratch clone也有自己的patterns；本片不改這些workflow/helper，不豁免tool_hash或任何原判準。不合main、rebase、force或approve。\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-02T12:49:51Z","updated_at":"2026-11-02T12:49:51Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"310bebb505ea04309634279b7025c1849a35d88d","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"ZhiQiYang:codex/ci-documents-checkout-20261102","ref":"codex/ci-documents-checkout-20261102","repo":{"id":1375165580,"node_id":"R_kgDOUfdcjA","name":"geometry-axiom","full_name":"ZhiQiYang/geometry-axiom","owner":{"login":"ZhiQiYang","id":59477728,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDc3NzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59477728?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang","html_url":"https://github.com/ZhiQiYang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZhiQiYang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":false,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":"Geometry model and editor governed by explicit axioms, with reference-based